task-128 DeepSeek structured-output policy

ROOT CAUSE: provider-openai advertised structuredOutputs native for every model and sent
response_format json_schema. DeepSeek rejects json_schema; benchmark structured cases failed immediately.

FIX
- getOpenAICapabilities: DeepSeek model ids -> structuredOutputs "json-fallback".
- chat-completions builder: DeepSeek structured requests send {type:"json_object"}; explicit benchmark
  response_format {type:"json_schema"} is rewritten to json_object for DeepSeek.
- normalize reports structuredOutputMode "json-fallback".
- benchmark-runner: DeepSeek subject deliverables and DeepSeek judge/compare use json_object rather
  than JUDGE_RESPONSE_FORMAT/COMPARE_RESPONSE_FORMAT.

TESTS
- provider-openai 37/37 incl DeepSeek json_object, no json_schema, fake upstream rejects json_schema/
  accepts json_object and parses JSON; RED captured (1 failed) with policy disabled.
- benchmark-runner judge+compare 19/19 incl DeepSeek subject receives json_object and case grades >0.
- host tsc 0.

